<title>USA: DDL ends talks with Circuit Systems.</title>
<headline>DDL ends talks with Circuit Systems.</headline>
<dateline>NEWBURY PARK, Calif. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DDL Electronics Inc said on Friday it had ended merger talks with Circuit Systems Inc, a manufacturer of single-sided, double-sided and multilayer printed circuit boards for the electronics industry.</p>
<p>DDL had been in discussions with Circuit Systems regarding a possible stock-for-stock merger.</p>
<p>DDL said the companies had been unable to agree on terms.</p>
</text>
